cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use nanorouter or its dataset in your work, cite it as below."
title: "nanorouter: schema-valid routing JSON from a fine-tuned 0.5B SLM"
abstract: >-
  A fine-tuning harness for small language models that emit routing JSON which
  validates against a strict tool schema. Includes a deterministic synthetic
  dataset with hard negatives, an evaluation harness with prompt baselines,
  a CLI, an HTTP API, GGUF and ONNX export, and a published LoRA adapter.
authors:
